    {
      "id": "respond-to-visitor",
      "name": "Respond to Visitor",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1300,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ ok: true, first_name: $json.first_name, reply: ($json.tier === 'Spam' || !$json.ai_reply) ? {en: 'Thanks for reaching out! Your request has been received and I will get back to you shortly.\\n\\nBest regards,\\nMohammad Adeeb', ar: 'شكراً لتواصلك! وصلني طلبك وسأعود إليك قريباً.\\n\\nمع أطيب التحيات،\\nمحمد أديب', tr: 'İletişime geçtiğiniz için teşekkürler! Talebiniz alındı, en kısa sürede dönüş yapacağım.\\n\\nSaygılarımla,\\nMohammad Adeeb'}[$json.lang] : $json.ai_reply }) }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
